        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek B1202SS, Classic Top Mount Stainless Steel Barn Door Kit</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Top Mount Classic Stainless Steel Barn Door Kit. It is available with either a spoked or solid wheel design in 2 finishes. The track comes in 6 different lengths to accommodate a wide variety of openings for a single or double door application.  It comes packaged with all necessary installation hardware and features an anti-jump design that will keep the sliding door from easily coming off the track.  Optional soft open/close kit available.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Sliding Barn Door Kit:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Comes with all necessary hardware to install wood barn door.</b></li>\r\n<li>Anti-jump Mechanism.</li>\r\n<li>Comes with a Floor Guide.</li>\r\n<li>The wall or structure that your system will be mounted on must be designed to support a maximum door weight of 400 lbs.</li>\r\n</ul> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Top Mount Barn Door Kit:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel </li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-B120105-SD-FT-SS-Install.pdf?v=1704262431\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek B1202SS Installation Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-B120105-SD-FT-SS-specifications.pdf?v=1704262431\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek B1202SS Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Package Includes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Track</li>\r\n<li>2  Hangers with Attached Wheels</li>\r\n<li>2 Stainless Steel Door Stops</li>\r\n<li>1 Floor Mounted Door Guide</li>\r\n<li>Track Fasteners</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Track Stops</li>\r\n<li>Drywall Anti-crush spacers</li>\r\n<li>All necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a set</i>\r\n</p>",
